      "source": [
        "# input\n",
        "\n",
        "Optionally print a prompt and read a line from standard input without its trailing newline.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Signature:** `input(prompt='', /)`\n",
        "\n",
        "Raises `EOFError` on end-of-file.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "03da2ddb0974a26d",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
        "name = input('Name: ')\n"
